{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓國人氣女團IVE成員張元英昨日與隊友出席韓國年度音樂盛事《Melon Music Awards》（MMA 2026），今晨她單拖襲港，於傍晚參加主題樂園的聖誕樹亮燈禮，大批粉絲一早到場霸靚位，至活動開始前更聚集數千人，場面相當墟冚。</p><p>&lt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T11:57:19.794402+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T11:07:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T11:50:41.951837+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T11:50:41.951837+00:00","content_hash":"67a74fe96f91a999ec8f062f2c1de921bf104c47d9dadc95cbce92993d807bd6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}